Saved/Screenshots/
Saved/Autosaves/
Saved/ShaderDebugInfo/
Saved/Logs/
Saved/Crashes/
Saved/SourceControl/

# ---- full-resolution evidence PNGs ------------------------------------------
# The records reference these; the downsampled set in Docs/evidence carries the
# same information at 1/100th the size.
# recursive - a views/ subfolder slipped past a single-level pattern
Saved/**/*.png
Saved/**/*.jpg
!Docs/evidence/*.jpg
Saved/Stage1/obj_w/
Saved/Stage2/data/*.json

